            the documentation
          </a>{" "}
          to learn more about Sanity.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="margin-block-end-5">
        <h3 class="margin-block-start-4 text-lg welcome-heading">Join the Sanity Community</h3>
        <p class="font-serif text-base">
          Leverage{" "}
          <a
            class="text-blue-600 no-underline"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow"
            href="https://www.sanity.io/exchange/community"
          >
            our awesome community
          </a>
          , and share tips and discuss!
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
@media (min-width: 640px) {
  .welcome-heading { margin-block-start: var(--spacing-5); }
